abstract: >-
  A concept-level knowledge base for the Meta-Consciousness Theory:
  64 term definitions, 122 curated Q&A pairs, 270 typed concept relations and
  213 source quotations, each traceable to a document and a character range.
  Published as a Python package, an MCP server, a static site and open datasets.
